```java
interface PaymentMethod {        // <<interface>> in UML
    void pay(BigDecimal amount);
}
class CreditCard implements PaymentMethod {   // dashed + hollow triangle
    public void pay(BigDecimal amount) { /* charge card */ }
}
class UpiPayment implements PaymentMethod {
    public void pay(BigDecimal amount) { /* UPI */ }
}
abstract class Wallet implements PaymentMethod { /* italic name; solid arrow from subclasses */ }
```
*Two implementers realize the interface (dashed); an abstract `Wallet` can implement it and be extended (solid).*

