```java
class ParkingLot   { List<ParkingFloor> floors; Optional<ParkingTicket> park(Vehicle v); }
class ParkingFloor { List<ParkingSpot> spots;  Optional<ParkingSpot> findFree(SpotSize s); }
class ParkingSpot  { SpotSize size; boolean free; boolean park(Vehicle v); }
abstract class Vehicle { String plate; SpotSize requiredSize(); }
class Car extends Vehicle { SpotSize requiredSize() { return SpotSize.REGULAR; } }
```
*Three composition links down the chain, one inheritance fan for vehicles.*
